WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.534
-Doctors are asking people
on TikTok

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:05.300
to stop sticking garlic cloves
up their nose

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:07.200
to clear their sinuses.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.734
I feel like this happens
once a month

00:00:08.734 --> 00:00:10.801
where people do something
dangerous they see online.

00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:13.300
So I wrote a tiny song about it.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.467
Hope you enjoy.

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:16.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.968 --> 00:00:20.367
[ Up-tempo music plays ]

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:26.267
♪ I have to tell you something
that everybody knows ♪

00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:28.934
♪ You shouldn't stick a clove
of garlic up into your nose ♪

00:00:28.934 --> 00:00:30.634
♪ Don't do it ♪

00:00:30.634 --> 00:00:32.934
♪ No, don't do it ♪

00:00:32.934 --> 00:00:35.067
♪♪

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.400
♪ The doctors
are concerned for you ♪

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:37.601
♪ It really isn't great ♪

00:00:37.601 --> 00:00:38.901
♪ Did you bump your head ♪

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:40.501
♪ When you fell
off a milk crate? ♪

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:42.267
♪ Don't do it ♪

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:44.400
♪ No, no, don't do it ♪

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.701
♪♪

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:49.033
♪ Garlic is for pasta
or a nice vinaigrette ♪

00:00:49.033 --> 00:00:50.534
♪ But if you stick it
up your sniffer ♪

00:00:50.534 --> 00:00:51.934
♪ All you get is some regret ♪

00:00:51.934 --> 00:00:53.701
♪ Don't do it ♪

00:00:53.701 --> 00:00:56.267
♪ No, no, no, don't do it ♪

00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:57.701
One more time.

00:00:57.701 --> 00:01:00.567
♪ Sticking stuff into your nose
really isn't good ♪

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:02.300
♪ But if you're talking
'bout a COVID test ♪

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:03.501
♪ I really think you should ♪

00:01:03.501 --> 00:01:05.100
♪ So do it ♪

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:10.234
♪ Yeah, yeah, you should do it ♪

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:13.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:15.100
[ Whistling ]

